## How to run

```bash
.venv\Scripts\activate
streamlit run streamlit_app.py
```

Requires Phase 1 + Phase 2 artefacts to already exist (`models/*.joblib`,
`models/shap_values.joblib`) — all committed, so a fresh clone works without
retraining.

